{
  "id": "ch02_s26_shuge",
  "chapter": 2,
  "act": 2,
  "scene": "shuge",
  "palette": "ink",
  "cast": [
    "wuze",
    "liuchenghuan"
  ],
  "weightless": false,
  "leavesLetter": [],
  "purpose": "主角确实为她的照顾心动，也看见没有说出的自己",
  "lines": [
    {
      "id": "ch02_s26_shuge.l1",
      "who": "narr",
      "kind": "aside",
      "text": "名册的两行字已经读过，你在柳的杯边坐下。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch02_s26_shuge.l2",
      "who": "narr",
      "kind": "aside",
      "text": "柳把杯子转了半圈，杯沿缺口朝向自己。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch02_s26_shuge.l3",
      "who": "liuchenghuan",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "这里不烫，拿这里。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch02_s26_shuge.l4",
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "这里。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch02_s26_shuge.l5",
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "open",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "拿杯的手，你也记得。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch02_s26_shuge.l6",
      "who": "liuchenghuan",
      "expr": "open",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "见过，就记得。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch02_s26_shuge.l7",
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "open",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch02_s26_shuge.l8",
      "who": "narr",
      "kind": "aside",
      "text": "你接住她留下的那半边杯沿，掌心贴上暖处，没有立刻喝。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch02_s26_shuge.l9",
      "who": "self",
      "kind": "inner",
      "text": "（再坐一会儿。和她。这样舒服，我不想立刻问别的。）"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch02_s26_shuge.l10",
      "when": {
        "flag.chenghuan_accept_1": true
      },
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "没去抄试？"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch02_s26_shuge.l11",
      "when": {
        "flag.chenghuan_accept_1": true
      },
      "who": "liuchenghuan",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "稿送到了，你没误时就好。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch02_s26_shuge.l12",
      "when": {
        "flag.chenghuan_accept_1": true
      },
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "稿到了。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch02_s26_shuge.l13",
      "when": {
        "flag.chenghuan_accept_1": true
      },
      "who": "self",
      "kind": "inner",
      "text": "（我看见那张报名牒了。还是把稿交给了她。）"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch02_s26_shuge.l14",
      "when": {
        "flag.chenghuan_refuse_1": true
      },
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "后来去抄试了么？"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch02_s26_shuge.l15",
      "when": {
        "flag.chenghuan_refuse_1": true
      },
      "who": "liuchenghuan",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "去了，散后还来看看缺不缺人。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch02_s26_shuge.l16",
      "when": {
        "flag.chenghuan_refuse_1": true
      },
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "散后……"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch02_s26_shuge.l17",
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "你自己喝什么？"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch02_s26_shuge.l18",
      "who": "liuchenghuan",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "剩下的正好。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch02_s26_shuge.l19",
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "不是剩多少，我问——"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch02_s26_shuge.l20",
      "who": "liuchenghuan",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "你喜欢哪样，就哪样。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch02_s26_shuge.l21",
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch02_s26_shuge.l22",
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "我问你，喜欢热的还是放温的？"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch02_s26_shuge.l23",
      "who": "narr",
      "kind": "aside",
      "text": "你把手从杯边拿开。她跟着去拿壶，以为要添水。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch02_s26_shuge.l24",
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "阿荻叫我先问，你倒不用我问。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch02_s26_shuge.l25",
      "who": "liuchenghuan",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "问……"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch02_s26_shuge.l26",
      "who": "liuchenghuan",
      "expr": "open",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "要问的那么多，来这里歇歇。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch02_s26_shuge.l27",
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "open",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "我……"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch02_s26_shuge.l28",
      "who": "liuchenghuan",
      "expr": "open",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "你要的，就是我要的。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch02_s26_shuge.l29",
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "guarded",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "可你的半日，不是我的。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch02_s26_shuge.l30",
      "who": "liuchenghuan",
      "expr": "guarded",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch02_s26_shuge.l31",
      "who": "liuchenghuan",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "不选我也没关系，在这里就好。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch02_s26_shuge.l32",
      "who": "narr",
      "kind": "aside",
      "text": "门外有人递来公主的全稿。柳先让开，你没有把自己的杯子放进她手里。"
    }
  ],
  "goto": "ch02_s24_shuge"
}
